  partName: Turbine Nozzle
  description: The turbine nozzle is a large, elongated component positioned at the
    center of the engine, responsible for directing hot gases towards the turbine
    blades and optimizing energy extraction. Its metal-bright material and high vertex
    count indicate a focus on durability and high-temperature resistance. The turbine
    nozzle plays a critical role in achieving efficient energy transfer and power
    generation.
